              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak boisionik che ng’etunotin che bo Hesekia, ak boisionikyik che miach, ogeero, sirotin eng’ ng’ang’utietab maotiot Isaia weritab Amos, eng’ bukuitab laitorinikab Juda ak Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
